Make a selection, get a result.

00:16:32.544 --> 00:16:34.244
Every time.

00:16:35.004 --> 00:16:38.537
A tool is a ready-to-use creative template

00:16:38.613 --> 00:16:41.255
that knows exactly what it's making and

00:16:41.315 --> 00:16:42.344
how.

00:16:43.110 --> 00:16:46.326
Give it a headline, a date, a number - and

00:16:46.395 --> 00:16:49.919
it produces a finished asset, to spec.

00:16:50.731 --> 00:16:53.893
No design experience needed.

00:16:54.684 --> 00:16:57.448
No decisions about fonts, colors or

00:16:57.510 --> 00:17:00.644
spacing - the tool already knows best.

00:17:01.407 --> 00:17:04.183
Whether you're a designer, a marketer, a

00:17:04.236 --> 00:17:07.739
developer or an AI agent, the output is

00:17:07.797 --> 00:17:09.095
the same.

00:17:09.865 --> 00:17:12.576
Tools are authored once by the people who

00:17:12.636 --> 00:17:15.746
know the brand, and then used by everyone

00:17:15.805 --> 00:17:19.134
else - from a web browser, a phone, the

00:17:19.195 --> 00:17:22.794
command line or an automated pipeline.

00:17:23.572 --> 00:17:26.704
The design decisions are locked in at the

00:17:26.789 --> 00:17:28.394
template level.

00:17:29.164 --> 00:17:31.999
The only thing left to do is fill in the

00:17:32.062 --> 00:17:33.394
content.
